  "historical_output_text": " Share details like the activities that go in with and what draws them to do it.\nOfc I know you have no idea I even *exist,  * but just FY info: have you seen me on any hikes or in a kayak recently 🤪 lol. Lately, the trails up the back mountain and kayacking around Lake W are like *addic*. Just the other morning got back up at sun rise & had the trail pretty well for a lil run before the hikers got in. Feelt like an old timer, but still *crank* for those 6-8mi day trips on trails and then paddling. It just makes u forget the stress. Then the kayacks have become this lil secret getaway from everything else, I can be on that lil boat by myself with a cup of chai and a couple books",
